		{
			description: [
				"You can easily make a spawner based farm, their spawn range is 4 blocks, making it a 9x9 block, however, mob spawning conditions change from mob to mob, light level, footing, space necessary, etc. "
				""
				"Things to take into consideration on whether to make spawner farm or a natural spawn farm is that farms based on natural spawning can be massively more productive, at the same time they can also be much bigger, clunckier, and harder to design and build."
				""
				"Also don't forget that mob spawners ignore mob caps"
			]
			id: "665FF471B5FBCE2C"
			subtitle: "Kinda expensive however"
